## Q9: Configure Monitoring and Logging in AKS

### ✅ Enable Monitoring in AKS

az aks create \
  --resource-group myResourceGroup \
  --name myAKSCluster \
  --enable-addons monitoring \
  --workspace-resource-id "/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/<rg-name>/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/<workspace-name>"

### ✅ Install kubectl tools for logging

go install github.com/stern/stern@latest
stern nginx

kubectl logs <pod-name>

kubectl top nodes
kubectl top pods
